// Interface text that lives in the components themselves rather than in the
// per-language files: labels, placeholders, toasts, and the server's error
// messages. Keyed by the text exactly as the component (or server) writes it,
// so every translator that already checks TRANSLATIONS finds these too.
// `uz` is only set where the source text is not Uzbek (English server messages,
// a few English labels), so Uzbek users don't see English.
